### Create vector map

POST api.ddev.site/vector_maps/
Content-Type: application/json
dev-mode-secret: supersecret123
dev-mode-name: test_user

{
  "title": "Dresden",
  "description": "Dresden city area",
  "geojson": {
    "type": "FeatureCollection",
    "features": [
      {
        "type": "Feature",
        "properties": {},
        "geometry": {
          "coordinates": [
            [
              [
                13.47067215549103,
                51.204420835808065
              ],
              [
                13.47067215549103,
                50.8292773400147
              ],
              [
                14.123496020148508,
                50.8292773400147
              ],
              [
                14.123496020148508,
                51.204420835808065
              ],
              [
                13.47067215549103,
                51.204420835808065
              ]
            ]
          ],
          "type": "Polygon"
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}

> {% client.global.set("vector_map_id", response.body.id) %}


### Get Vector Map

GET api.ddev.site/vector_maps/{{vector_map_id}}

