### Get vector map roles

GET api.ddev.site/vector_maps/{{vector_map_id}}/roles
Content-Type: application/json
dev-mode-secret: supersecret123
dev-mode-name: test_user


### Create vector map role
POST api.ddev.site/vector_maps/{{vector_map_id}}/roles/add
Content-Type: application/json
dev-mode-secret: supersecret123
dev-mode-name: test_user

{
  "user_id": "test_user_2",
  "role": "editor"
}

